    "accessibility": {
      "short": "Diamond-shaped abstract painting with black grid lines, yellow and blue triangles, a black rectangle, and a small red square on a white background.",
      "long": "A square canvas presented as a diamond, featuring a grid of thick black horizontal and vertical lines that intersect to form compartments. In the upper-left compartment is a large yellow right triangle; in the lower-left, a black rectangle; in the lower-right, a blue right triangle; and near the bottom center, a small red-orange square. The background is white, and subtle cracking (craquelure) is visible in the yellow pigment.",
